:''This article is about the Cat. For the Enemy Unit, see [[Haniwanwan]].''
'''Ancient Egg: N001''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Empress' Excavation 1]]. It was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] improves almost all attributes and gains Behemoth Slayer.

